      "content": "SP 90 SE                          ASHLEY GREEN            WHELPLEY HILL 2/18                                                           Barn to South-West of                                                           Berry Farmhouse GV                                                           II C18 timber-framed and weatherboarded barn of 5 bays.  Old tile roof.  Wagon porch to bay 4 with lean-to at left and gabled.  Brick plinth and infill to lower part of framing.  Brick east gable.  Double purlin roof with queen struts and collar to upper purlin, lower with queen posts.  Curved braces to tie beams.  Mid-rail to walls. Listing NGR: SP9995804416"
    }
